  "label": "Appliance Fixing Trick: Hitting Appliances to Fix Them",
  "description": "The text references a real-world, albeit absurd, practical joke or trick where physically striking a malfunctioning appliance (like a microwave or toaster) is sometimes said to temporarily fix it. This is a well-known, albeit ineffective and dangerous, hack that is often shared in online forums or as a joke. The meme uses this as a darkly humorous analogy to suggest that women are expected to 'fix' problems in a similarly violent or damaging way.",
